# Compliance Checklist — Botium Toys

**Auditor:** Dwaine Coley
**Date:** June 2026

---

## Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard (PCI DSS)

| Best Practice | Adherent | Notes |
|---------------|----------|-------|
| Only authorized users access credit card information | No | All employees currently have broad system access |
| Credit card data stored in secure environment | No | No access controls or secure storage in place |
| Data encryption implemented | No | No encryption on stored or transmitted data |
| Secure password management policies adopted | No | No password policy or management system exists |

---

## General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)

| Best Practice | Adherent | Notes |
|---------------|----------|-------|
| EU customer data kept private and secured | No | No access controls or encryption protecting EU data |
| 72-hour breach notification plan in place | Yes | Plan exists to notify EU customers within 72 hours |
| Data properly classified and inventoried | No | No data classification system in place |
| Privacy policies enforced | Yes | Privacy policies are documented and maintained |

