## System and Organizations Controls (SOC 1/2)

| Best Practice | Adherent | Notes |
|---------------|----------|-------|
| User access policies established | No | No formal access control policies exist |
| Sensitive PII/SPII is confidential | No | No controls restricting access to sensitive data |
| Data integrity validated | Yes | Data is consistent, complete, and accurate |
| Data available to authorized users | Yes | Authorized users can access data as needed |

