## Compliance Summary

| Standard | Adherent | Not Adherent |
|----------|----------|--------------|
| PCI DSS | 0 | 4 |
| GDPR | 2 | 2 |
| SOC 1/2 | 2 | 2 |
| **Total** | **4** | **8** |

Botium Toys is non-compliant with PCI DSS across all four assessed
best practices. GDPR and SOC 1/2 show partial compliance. Immediate
remediation is required to avoid regulatory penalties and reduce
risk to customer data.
